<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:02:03.340 --> 00:02:07.800
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:02:10.110 --> 00:02:12.620
VAMPIANS

00:02:13.890 --> 00:02:16.140
<i>The movie will begin momentarily.</i>

00:02:16.640 --> 00:02:22.560
<i>Viewers are asked to turn off their
cell phones during the movie.</i>

00:02:23.070 --> 00:02:29.950
<i>We also ask that people not talk during
the movie, as it can disturb others.</i>

00:02:35.620 --> 00:02:38.120
What is this? It's strange...

00:02:53.050 --> 00:02:55.350
Tomo, you there?

00:02:55.680 --> 00:02:57.680
The movie's starting.

00:03:00.390 --> 00:03:01.290
Tomo?

00:03:01.560 --> 00:03:02.810
Are you...?

00:03:17.810 --> 00:03:18.870
CHAPTER 30

00:03:19.410 --> 00:03:23.810
THE VAMPIRE'S HALLOWEEN PARTY

00:03:24.670 --> 00:03:27.000
Happy Halloween!

00:03:27.420 --> 00:03:28.780
Candy, candy!

00:03:28.780 --> 00:03:30.320
Strange country.

00:03:30.320 --> 00:03:35.390
I don't understand why they're celebrating
a Western festival.

00:03:35.760 --> 00:03:37.820
I mean... What?

00:03:37.820 --> 00:03:40.350
Trick or treat!

00:03:52.680 --> 00:03:54.680
Screw Halloween.

00:03:55.030 --> 00:03:57.280
What's this about all of a sudden?

00:03:57.700 --> 00:04:03.060
It was only a little while ago when
nobody cared about Halloween at all!

00:04:03.060 --> 00:04:06.980
A product of commercialism!
It's just a cosplay festival!

00:04:06.980 --> 00:04:09.150
The stupid pickup artists
and crowded streets!

00:04:09.150 --> 00:04:10.530
I hate it!

00:04:10.960 --> 00:04:15.080
You're acting like Halloween
killed your parents or something.

00:04:15.080 --> 00:04:19.410
She's jealous there aren't any
festivals celebrating Japanese <i>yokai</i>.

00:04:21.640 --> 00:04:23.100
Honestly.

00:04:26.360 --> 00:04:30.380
I didn't know
you hated Halloween, Cat-san.

00:04:30.440 --> 00:04:31.820
<i>"Let's go to the Halloween Screening!!"</i>

00:04:30.860 --> 00:04:34.300
Sorry for inviting you to
an event like this.

00:04:31.940 --> 00:04:33.860
<i>"Hello."</i>

00:04:33.990 --> 00:04:35.280
<i>"Nope."</i>

00:04:34.300 --> 00:04:35.970
No, it's fine.

00:04:35.410 --> 00:04:37.620
<i>"Scratch, scratch."</i>

00:04:35.970 --> 00:04:41.700
I hate Halloween, but it's not the
limited-time-only pumpkin sweets' fault.

00:04:37.740 --> 00:04:38.950
<i>"We could've gotten pumpkin sweets.'"</i>

00:04:42.450 --> 00:04:44.210
COSPLAY WELCOME
HALLOWEEN SCREENING

00:04:42.830 --> 00:04:44.270
Sweets are innocent!

00:04:45.420 --> 00:04:46.600
Yay!

00:04:47.420 --> 00:04:48.750
Here.

00:04:50.800 --> 00:04:52.260
Here you go.

00:04:54.550 --> 00:04:57.370
Don't hold up the line.
Just go to your seat.

00:04:57.370 --> 00:04:58.260
Huh?

00:04:58.970 --> 00:05:00.620
A-A-A <i>yokai</i>?!

00:05:00.620 --> 00:05:01.960
What a letdown.

00:05:01.960 --> 00:05:04.210
If you're here, does that mean

00:05:04.210 --> 00:05:09.840
this event is some scam to sell us pricey
down futons after handing out free sweets?

00:05:10.230 --> 00:05:12.820
Yeah, I wish it was...

00:05:13.400 --> 00:05:15.300
Sadly, today,

00:05:15.610 --> 00:05:22.410
I'm a pathetic part-timer wasting
the holiday working minimum wage.

00:05:23.470 --> 00:05:27.290
Th-There, there. Cheer up, Rat Man-san.

00:05:27.750 --> 00:05:28.980
I mean, seriously!

00:05:28.980 --> 00:05:34.360
It was only a little while ago when
nobody cared about Halloween at all!

00:05:34.360 --> 00:05:37.830
A product of commercialism!
It's just a cosplay festival!

00:05:37.830 --> 00:05:39.370
The stupid couples
and crowded streets!

00:05:39.930 --> 00:05:41.760
Screw Halloween!

00:05:42.390 --> 00:05:44.470
I've heard that somewhere...

00:05:45.560 --> 00:05:50.380
Oh? We have some unexpected guests.

00:05:56.880 --> 00:05:59.070
Are you fine with scary movies?

00:05:59.410 --> 00:06:04.770
Come on, Cat-san.
I've already seen tons of real <i>yokai</i>.

00:06:04.770 --> 00:06:05.770
This is nothing!

00:06:05.770 --> 00:06:08.110
"Numerous viewers in America fainted."

00:06:08.110 --> 00:06:10.540
"Banned in 15 states."

00:06:11.210 --> 00:06:16.160
"Rumors an actor who died
in an accident during filming appears."

00:06:16.160 --> 00:06:21.910
"Includes heart attack insurance for those
who die of shock. Graves set in Hawaii."

00:06:22.470 --> 00:06:23.930
Cat-san.

00:06:25.560 --> 00:06:27.430
Can I hold your hand?

00:06:28.460 --> 00:06:32.460
Sure thing! I'll record it
and show it to you later.

00:06:33.150 --> 00:06:34.880
Won't you get in trouble?

00:06:34.880 --> 00:06:37.180
Then again, it's a free event after all.

00:06:37.180 --> 00:06:38.470
It's fine!

00:06:38.470 --> 00:06:40.340
Anyway... Huh?

00:06:40.410 --> 00:06:44.790
NO SIGNAL

00:06:40.910 --> 00:06:42.240
No signal?

00:06:42.620 --> 00:06:44.850
No way. Me too.

00:06:47.160 --> 00:06:48.540
Seriously?

00:06:50.250 --> 00:06:54.110
No signal anywhere. This theater sucks.

00:06:54.110 --> 00:06:56.170
Is there a problem?

00:06:56.880 --> 00:06:57.860
Huh?

00:06:59.860 --> 00:07:01.820
Uh, my smartphone...

00:07:07.660 --> 00:07:10.910
Happy Halloween!

00:07:13.150 --> 00:07:15.480
<i>The movie will begin momentarily.</i>

00:07:15.900 --> 00:07:21.860
<i>Viewers are asked to turn off their
cell phones during the movie.</i>

00:07:22.700 --> 00:07:24.640
Tomo, you there?

00:07:24.640 --> 00:07:26.580
The movie's starting.

00:07:29.500 --> 00:07:30.520
Tomo?

00:07:42.380 --> 00:07:43.280
Huh?

00:07:48.430 --> 00:07:49.560
Stop it!

00:07:55.480 --> 00:07:57.050
Nothing.

00:07:57.050 --> 00:08:00.380
I don't think
the ring's going to appear today.

00:08:00.380 --> 00:08:03.890
Hmm. What a fickle little ring.

00:08:03.890 --> 00:08:08.180
If we could just find a way to set up
a long-term forecast.

00:08:08.180 --> 00:08:11.850
The land's spiritual energy field
is interfering with the ring's magic

00:08:11.850 --> 00:08:13.690
and warping the causality.

00:08:14.120 --> 00:08:19.840
When and where the ring will manifest are
beyond the realm of magical physics now.

00:08:21.300 --> 00:08:23.570
Say it so we can understand.

00:08:23.570 --> 00:08:29.930
Currently, our only method is to
rely on this crystal's last-minute alerts.

00:08:30.330 --> 00:08:31.620
Is it the ring?

00:08:31.620 --> 00:08:34.330
No, this reading is...

00:08:44.320 --> 00:08:47.340
It's showtime!

00:08:59.920 --> 00:09:03.360
Japanese girls are so adorable.

00:09:03.360 --> 00:09:05.450
They're like dolls.

00:09:05.840 --> 00:09:10.080
I don't know what Backbeard-sama will say,

00:09:10.080 --> 00:09:14.330
but I'd like to add them to
my vampire army.

00:09:26.360 --> 00:09:27.970
This is kid stuff.

00:09:47.860 --> 00:09:49.620
W-We're surrounded!

00:09:49.620 --> 00:09:51.760
It's just VR.

00:10:07.610 --> 00:10:10.120
Huh?! Huh?! Huh?!

00:10:10.660 --> 00:10:12.310
I figured they were there.

00:10:12.310 --> 00:10:16.810
Degenerates who'll try doing mischief
because we're wearing goggles.

00:10:19.270 --> 00:10:20.380
Huh?!

00:10:23.050 --> 00:10:25.280
Th-This is VR, right?!

00:10:25.280 --> 00:10:26.530
Isn't it?!

00:10:26.530 --> 00:10:28.780
Why?! What is this?!

00:10:31.030 --> 00:10:33.430
Vampires! This is...

00:10:35.390 --> 00:10:38.990
<i>As owner of this Vampire Theater,</i>

00:10:38.990 --> 00:10:43.050
<i>allow me, Carmilla, to welcome you.</i>

00:10:43.050 --> 00:10:44.590
What?!

00:10:44.590 --> 00:10:50.050
<i>Since you're here, let's have you
experience loads of fear.</i>

00:10:50.490 --> 00:10:53.780
<i>Women's screams make for superb music.</i>

00:10:54.120 --> 00:10:56.870
<i>Let me hear your beautiful notes.</i>

00:11:02.060 --> 00:11:05.000
Evil begone! Evil begone!

00:11:05.800 --> 00:11:10.070
Darn it! Is it even possible
for vampires to be immune to crosses?!

00:11:20.020 --> 00:11:21.080
Is this...?

00:11:21.080 --> 00:11:22.520
<i>Nogi kahn</i>

00:11:25.440 --> 00:11:28.400
This is the building that used to be here.

00:11:35.950 --> 00:11:37.310
It's been moved

00:11:37.950 --> 00:11:42.460
to another dimension, a separate world
next to this one.

00:11:43.130 --> 00:11:47.820
Judging from my crystal ball's response,
this is one of Adele's magic gems.

00:11:53.820 --> 00:11:55.820
COSPLAY WELCOME
HALLOWEEN SCREENING

00:11:56.100 --> 00:12:00.750
Dad, Catchick said she was going to
see a movie with Mana...

00:12:00.750 --> 00:12:02.690
C-Could it be...?!

00:12:04.810 --> 00:12:07.840
Stand back. I'll open a path with magic.

00:12:09.230 --> 00:12:11.280
<i>Shitariu kozomo</i>

00:12:14.870 --> 00:12:16.700
<i>Shitariu kozomo!</i>

00:12:32.840 --> 00:12:35.160
KITARO WANTED!

00:12:36.180 --> 00:12:39.660
MALAY <i>YOKAI</i> KEMPAS HEBI

00:12:37.720 --> 00:12:38.600
-<i>"Wobble, wobble."</i>
-<i>"Shake, shake."</i>

00:12:38.720 --> 00:12:39.600
<i>"What is this guy...?"</i>

00:12:48.920 --> 00:12:50.170
Trick or--

00:13:07.480 --> 00:13:09.800
My smartphone can't find a signal!

00:13:15.880 --> 00:13:17.580
Let's find Carmilla!

00:13:17.580 --> 00:13:20.830
I bet if we defeat her,
everyone will be restored!

00:13:23.390 --> 00:13:25.330
You can't escape.

00:13:26.440 --> 00:13:31.280
This Vampire Theater has no exits.

00:13:33.920 --> 00:13:35.920
<i>Shitariu kozomo!</i>

00:13:38.200 --> 00:13:40.800
That's enough, Agnes.

00:13:43.660 --> 00:13:44.810
Adele...

00:13:44.810 --> 00:13:47.650
She traced my magic diffusion pattern

00:13:47.650 --> 00:13:51.090
and incorporated
an auto-countering shield!

00:13:52.320 --> 00:13:55.070
I said say it so we can understand!

00:13:55.070 --> 00:13:58.580
My magic can't pierce this shield!

00:13:58.580 --> 00:14:00.350
Then let's try this.

00:14:00.680 --> 00:14:02.280
Remote Controlled Geta!

00:14:10.060 --> 00:14:12.190
<i>Catchick! Mana!</i>

00:14:13.190 --> 00:14:14.340
Lend me your hand.

00:14:14.340 --> 00:14:16.900
Huh? What should I do?

00:14:17.200 --> 00:14:18.200
Your hand.

00:14:18.910 --> 00:14:20.490
Lend me your hand.

00:14:24.410 --> 00:14:29.570
<i>Adele's shield is specifically engineered
to neutralize my magic.</i>

00:14:29.570 --> 00:14:32.360
<i>If I include a foreign element like</i>
<i>Kitaro's </i>yokai<i> power,</i>

00:14:32.360 --> 00:14:35.690
<i>the magic's diffusion pattern
should change.</i>

00:14:36.300 --> 00:14:40.590
<i>It should stop being "my" magic.</i>

00:15:03.530 --> 00:15:06.390
We're around here.

00:15:06.910 --> 00:15:11.400
Carmilla is probably in
the owner's room on the second floor.

00:15:11.710 --> 00:15:16.130
The ducts aren't connected.
We'll have to go out.

00:15:36.190 --> 00:15:37.800
Cat-san, hurry!

00:15:37.800 --> 00:15:39.280
Be careful!

00:15:51.540 --> 00:15:52.790
Carmilla!

00:15:57.210 --> 00:15:59.010
It wasn't here?

00:15:59.380 --> 00:16:04.200
No, this is definitely the room
from the screen...

00:16:15.420 --> 00:16:19.220
<i>As owner of this Vampire Theater,</i>

00:16:19.220 --> 00:16:23.430
<i>allow me, Carmilla, to welcome you.</i>

00:16:39.250 --> 00:16:40.900
Clever girl.

00:16:45.010 --> 00:16:46.910
A world in the mirror.

00:16:48.910 --> 00:16:50.410
Oh my.

00:16:50.770 --> 00:16:55.400
I work directly under Backbeard-sama.

00:16:56.310 --> 00:17:01.420
I'm Carmilla-sama, one of the
Western Yokai Three.

00:17:02.240 --> 00:17:06.800
You think a peon like yourself
can defeat me?

00:17:07.530 --> 00:17:09.830
Trick or treat.

00:17:10.290 --> 00:17:14.810
Give me blood or I'll be bad.

00:17:21.230 --> 00:17:22.990
Where are you aiming?

00:17:29.220 --> 00:17:31.850
<i>The </i>yokai<i> power and magic are clashing?!</i>

00:17:32.220 --> 00:17:35.480
<i>It's no good. I can't activate the spell!</i>

00:17:36.310 --> 00:17:37.750
How much longer?!

00:17:37.750 --> 00:17:41.260
-Hurry, Agnes! Time is--
-I'm doing it!

00:17:41.260 --> 00:17:45.140
You don't even have any idea
how complex magic is!

00:17:45.140 --> 00:17:48.140
You think I can do anything
because I'm a witch?!

00:17:48.490 --> 00:17:51.490
Don't push this all on me!

00:17:53.500 --> 00:17:55.140
What do I do?

00:17:55.460 --> 00:17:58.880
At this rate, Mana and Catchick will...!

00:18:00.590 --> 00:18:02.050
I'm sorry.

00:18:03.110 --> 00:18:04.550
You're not alone.

00:18:05.300 --> 00:18:06.930
I'm here with you.

00:18:16.350 --> 00:18:18.270
<i>Shitariu kozomo!</i>

00:18:34.330 --> 00:18:35.520
What are these?!

00:18:35.870 --> 00:18:38.040
Humans turned to vampires.

00:18:40.670 --> 00:18:43.030
They'll be restored if we defeat Carmilla.

00:18:43.030 --> 00:18:47.280
It looks like we should probably
split up and search.

00:18:47.280 --> 00:18:48.760
Yes, Dad!

00:18:49.890 --> 00:18:51.220
Watch yourself.

00:18:57.890 --> 00:18:59.370
Out of my way!

00:19:06.380 --> 00:19:09.610
No! Go away!

00:19:12.390 --> 00:19:14.540
I can't hold on!

00:19:17.540 --> 00:19:18.830
Hair Needles!

00:19:29.170 --> 00:19:30.550
Kitaro!

00:19:35.180 --> 00:19:37.590
Cat-san's in the owner's room!

00:19:37.590 --> 00:19:39.540
She took those stairs!

00:19:39.540 --> 00:19:40.770
Got it.

00:19:41.140 --> 00:19:43.650
Wait inside that room.

00:20:03.040 --> 00:20:05.520
I won't finish you off here.

00:20:06.000 --> 00:20:10.970
I'll give you a pretty collar
and keep you as my pet.

00:20:12.470 --> 00:20:14.410
You can't run anymore.

00:20:14.800 --> 00:20:16.660
I wasn't running.

00:20:19.850 --> 00:20:21.120
I was luring you.

00:20:22.480 --> 00:20:24.060
Right there.

00:20:25.770 --> 00:20:26.920
Finger...

00:20:28.670 --> 00:20:29.940
Guns!

00:20:50.300 --> 00:20:52.740
You did it, Kitaro.

00:20:55.010 --> 00:20:56.850
You're late.

00:21:05.060 --> 00:21:06.880
Today was just for play.

00:21:07.690 --> 00:21:09.320
I'll see you again.

00:21:18.330 --> 00:21:21.290
After everything you just went through...

00:21:21.620 --> 00:21:23.430
Sweets are innocent!

00:21:23.430 --> 00:21:25.730
Weren't you scared alone?

00:21:25.730 --> 00:21:27.020
Nope.

00:21:27.020 --> 00:21:29.320
I'm Cat-san today.

00:21:29.320 --> 00:21:31.920
Vampires are nothing, right?

00:21:35.630 --> 00:21:37.800
Here. Have this.

00:21:38.280 --> 00:21:39.890
Hooray!

00:21:41.600 --> 00:21:44.250
All's well that ends well.

00:21:44.250 --> 00:21:45.390
Yes.

00:21:45.850 --> 00:21:47.940
By the way, Cat-san...

00:21:49.150 --> 00:21:52.070
I get the feeling
we're forgetting something.

00:22:00.780 --> 00:22:02.910
Screw Halloween.

00:22:06.620 --> 00:22:10.500
<i>You can't see them
But they're there</i>

00:22:06.620 --> 00:22:10.500
<i>mien keredomo orundayo</i>

00:22:12.050 --> 00:22:14.340
<i>"Hello" in the mountains</i>

00:22:12.050 --> 00:22:14.340
<i>yama de yahho</i>

00:22:14.460 --> 00:22:17.260
<i>If you call</i>

00:22:14.460 --> 00:22:17.260
<i>hitokoe yobeba</i>

00:22:17.380 --> 00:22:19.550
<i>An identical "Hello"</i>

00:22:17.380 --> 00:22:19.550
<i>onaji yahho</i>

00:22:19.680 --> 00:22:24.850
<i>The Yobuko calls back</i>

00:22:19.680 --> 00:22:24.850
<i>yobuko ga kaesu</i>

